# Using - https://github.com/Huachao/vscode-restclient

### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:3001/health

### Login — captures tokens into variables for subsequent requests
# @name login
POST http://127.0.0.1:3001/api/auth/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test"
}

@access_token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
@refresh_token = {{login.response.body.$.refresh_token}}

### Login — wrong password (should return 401)
POST http://127.0.0.1:3001/api/auth/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Verify token
GET http://127.0.0.1:3001/api/auth/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get current user
GET http://127.0.0.1:3001/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Logout
GET http://127.0.0.1:3001/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Refresh token
POST http://127.0.0.1:3001/api/auth/refresh
refresh_token: {{refresh_token}}
access_token: {{access_token}}

### List IAM users
GET http://127.0.0.1:3001/api/iam/iam-users
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### List roles
GET http://127.0.0.1:3001/api/iam/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get user by ID
GET http://127.0.0.1:3001/api/iam/iam-users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

# ─── Cross-service: using base-iam token against sample-api (port 3000) ───────

### Sample-api health
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/health

### Sample-api categories — verifies token issued by base-iam is accepted by sample-api's authUser
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/sample-api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
